{"parse": {"title": "Science all your life.", "pageid": 5280, "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #891100; border-collapse:collapse;\" cellpadding=\"3\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"background: #891100; color:#FFF;\">\n<td>\n<table class=\"toccolours\" align=\"center\" style=\"background: #891100; color: #FFF; width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-left: 10px;\">\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_1\" title=\"Series 1\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">1</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_2\" title=\"Series 2\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">2</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_3\" title=\"Series 3\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">3</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">4</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">5</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">6</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_7\" title=\"Series 7\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">9</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">10</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">11</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">12</span