t\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sometimes_spit.\" title=\"Sometimes spit.\">Sometimes spit.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.\" title=\"An invisible jump rope.\">An invisible jump rope.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.\" title=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\">Maybe we're the monsters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glass_half_most.\" title=\"Glass half most.\">Glass half most.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Science all your life.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_clever_side%3F\" title=\"The clever side?\">The clever side?</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Science all your life.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d0/Science_all_your_life..png/revision/latest?cb=20250619215652\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Science all your life.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d0/Science_all_your_life..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250619215652\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d0/Science_all_your_life..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250619215652 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d0/Science_all_your_life..png/revision/latest?cb=20250619215652 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Science all your life.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Science_all_your_life..png\" data-image-name=\"Science all your life..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glass_half_most.\" title=\"Glass half most.\">Glass half most.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Science all your life.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 19 June 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_Title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode Title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_Title\">Episode Title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode Title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Science_all_your_life.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode Title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> sings \"science all your life\" as part of his improvised theme tune to the 'Science Today' show, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Obey_the_autocue\" title=\"Obey the autocue\">Obey the autocue</a> task. The title card shows a washing machine filled with arts and crafts supplies, referencing the spinning platform of <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_your_memorable_scene_so_that_your_teammates_can_guess_your_three_words\" title=\"Paint your memorable scene so that your teammates can guess your three words\">Paint your memorable scene so that your teammates can guess your three words</a>.</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Science_all_your_life.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>The contestants work through something resembling a school curriculum, as they face tasks involving physical education, art and science. <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> pours scorn and drips praise where appropriate, as <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a> relives a difficult childhood memory, <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> retches into a balloon and <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> misinterprets <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a>'s hip-swaying mime. Meanwhile, <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a>'s meticulous records show that <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> chooses violence as the solution to a task for the 12th time this series.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/8/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_object_that_you%27ve_borrowed_from_a_fairly_close_friend\" title=\"Best object that you&#39;ve borrowed from a fairly close friend\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best object that you've borrowed from a fairly close friend.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fail_the_next_task_in_the_most_heartbreakingly_spectacular_way\" title=\"Fail the next task in the most heartbreakingly spectacular way\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Knock over all 10 skittles in 10 minutes. The final skittle should fall exactly when the whistle sounds. If any skittle is left standing after 10 minutes, you have failed. You must stay behind the rope at all times.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">-1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Fail the next task in the most heartbreakingly spectacular way. If you succeed in the next task, you will lose one point.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_your_memorable_scene_so_that_your_teammates_can_guess_your_three_words\" title=\"Paint your memorable scene so that your teammates can guess your three words\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Each person must write down three words to describe a memorable scene. You must be silent throughout and your teammates must not see what you have written.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team:</b> Paint your memorable scene so that your teammates can guess your three words. You must not give any clues about your own three-word scene except by painting the scene. You must not write any words.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Obey_the_autocue\" title=\"Obey the autocue\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Obey the autocue.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Say_whether_the_next_person_will_have_a_higher_or_lower_number_of_things_than_the_previous_person\" title=\"Say whether the next person will have a higher or lower number of things than the previous person\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Say whether the next person will have a higher or lower number of things than the previous person. The category of things will change each time. If you make two mistakes, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">23\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Science_all_your_life.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Alex shared a QR code at the start of the show, pointing to a bingo card at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://bingo.taskmaster.tv/\">https://bingo.taskmaster.tv/</a>.  Per the webpage's instructions, participants are tasked with selecting nine phrases from the grid that were spoken in that night's episode.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Science_all_your_life.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>Science all your life.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920135759\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1000/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27060/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 796/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800547/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   73.986      1 -total\n 50.32%   37.229      1 Template:Spoilers\n 47.92%   35.456      1 Template:MessageBox\n 24.51%   18.137      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 18.26%   13.513      1 Template:Episodes\n 10.21%    7.551     10 Template:Link\n  3.02%    2.233      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.34%    1.728      1 Template:Clear\n  2.23%    1.650      1 Template:Quote\n  1.77%    1.307      5 Template:Color\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:5280-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920135759 and revision id 44351. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}}}